  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Cut the paneer into small cubes and set aside.",
    "In a pan, heat some oil over medium heat and sauté the onion, ginger, and garlic until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add the cumin, coriander, turmeric, and red chili powder, and stir for 1 minute.",
    "Stir in the eggplantlicious curry and cook for 2-3 minutes.",
    "Add the paneer cubes and stir to coat with the spice mixture.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a baking dish and bake for 15-20 minutes, or until the paneer is lightly browned.",
    "Garnish with fresh cilantro and serve hot.",
    "Serve with naan, rice, or roti for a complete meal."
